When selection recategorised : CategoryChoice Vertical
| Category | Expenses:Auto:Fuel |
Then recategorising reported is : Recategorised Vertical
| Changed | 3 |
| Refused | 0 |
Then register lines are : RegisterLine CompareOnly
| Ref | Date       | Category           | Payment |
| T1  | 2026-02-01 | Expenses:Auto:Fuel | 40.00   |
| T2  | 2026-02-08 | Expenses:Auto:Fuel | 35.00   |
| T3  | 2026-02-15 | Expenses:Auto:Fuel | 30.00   |
# Nothing about the amounts moved. A category says where money went and cannot
# change how much of it there was, which is what makes a report total that does
# not move after a month of categorising worth checking. See transaction_edit.

Scenario A split in the selection is left alone and said so
Description A split has more than one category, so there is no single transaction
