Scenario Recategorising from the report moves the figures with it
Description The same operation as in the register, reached from the report. It
\ is the one place where recategorising is expected to change what
\ is on the page: the transaction leaves one category line and joins
\ another, and both totals move.
Given the chart of accounts is : ChartOfAccounts
| Path               | Type     | Placeholder |
| Assets:Checking    | Checking | false       |
| Expenses:Auto      | Expense  | true        |
| Expenses:Auto:Fuel | Expense  | false       |
| Expenses:Groceries | Expense  | false       |
