| Ref | Category           |
| T2  | Expenses:Auto:Fuel |
Then report rows are : ReportRow
| Account            | Level | Amount | IsSubtotal |
| Expenses           | 0     | 130.00 | true       |
| Expenses:Auto      | 1     | 130.00 | true       |
| Expenses:Auto:Fuel | 2     | 130.00 | false      |
# The 60.00 of groceries has become fuel, so Groceries has nothing in it and
# is gone from the page while Auto:Fuel holds the whole 130.00. The expenses
